      "name": "Plenty of meat on these bones",
      "sort": 100000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p data-visibility=\"gm\"><strong>Trigger</strong> 2 creatures, who aren't eating, stay in this room for more than a round.</p>\n<p><strong>Effect&nbsp;</strong>When the hunger pangs strike, all creatures in the room must make @Check[type:fortitude|dc:34] saves to resist being affected as though by a 6th lvl @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.siU9xRlqWXeKT0mH]{Feast of Ashes} spell and taking a days starvation damage immediately [[/r {5d4}]] and becoming @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued}&nbsp; from the sudden phantom hunger.</p>\n<p>Accompyanying this ravenous sensation is the conviction that only the flesh of the other PCs can sat ethe hunger. Any character who took starvation damage must make a @Check[type:will|dc:34] save to resist becoming</p>\n<ul>\n<li>@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy}</li>\n<li>@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled}</li>\n<li>@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied}</li>\n</ul>\n<p>as the cannibal urgings overwhelm the PC and drive them to the brink of madness.</p>\n<p>The hunger and conditions persists only until they eat someting.</p>"
        },
