      "level": {
        "value": 11
      },
      "disable": "<ul>\n<li>@Check[type:religion|dc:33|traits:haunt] (trained) to calm the spirits</li>\n<li>@Check[type:survival|dc:26|traits:haunt] (trained) to quickly retrieve and eat something before the hunger pangs escalate</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Anyone actually eating when the haunt triggers is immune.</p>",
